{"id":"ee07d81809d76030","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-qml-realization.md","title":"Arithmetical Realization of QML","display":"df-qml-realization — Arithmetical Realization of QML","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-qml-realization","aliases":["89-df-qml-realization"],"display":"df-qml-realization — Arithmetical Realization of QML","depends_on":["[[89-df-qml-formula]]","[[89-df-open-provability-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-qml-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-qml-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qml-realization — Arithmetical Realization of QML"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15c083801acd41a1\" href=\"?note=15c083801acd41a1\" title=\"89-df-qml-formula\">89-df-qml-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f748d191ce42f6ef\" href=\"?note=f748d191ce42f6ef\" title=\"89-df-open-provability-formula\">89-df-open-provability-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元谓词字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 指定算术公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(P)\">\\(r(P)\\)</span>，其自由变元恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\">\\(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(P)\">\\(r(P)\\)</span> 中的绑定变元先改名，保证同时代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_k\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\)</span> 时无捕获。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\bar x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\bar x)\\)</span> 取开放数词实例可证性定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是固定 PA 矛盾句。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^Q_r(P(x_1,\\ldots,x_k))&amp;\\coloneqq\nr(P)[v_0:=x_1,\\ldots,v_{k-1}:=x_k],\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\tau^Q_r(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^Q_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^Q_r(A)\\land\\tau^Q_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\exists xA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\tau^Q_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}[\\tau^Q_r(A)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^Q_r(P(x_1,\\ldots,x_k))&amp;\\coloneqq\nr(P)[v_0:=x_1,\\ldots,v_{k-1}:=x_k],\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\tau^Q_r(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^Q_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^Q_r(A)\\land\\tau^Q_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\exists xA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\tau^Q_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}[\\tau^Q_r(A)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 219–220；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n递归给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^Q_r:\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\tau^Q_r:\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，并保持自由变元集。为一个公式选择实现时只需指定其中有限多个谓词的像；未出现的谓词怎样扩张不影响翻译。零元谓词对应算术句子；重复参数由同时替换处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-qml-formula","status":"resolved","id":"15c083801acd41a1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-open-provability-formula","status":"resolved","id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-open-provability-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"r(P)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"r(P)","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^Q_r(P(x_1,\\ldots,x_k))&\\coloneqq\nr(P)[v_0:=x_1,\\ldots,v_{k-1}:=x_k],\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\tau^Q_r(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^Q_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\tau^Q_r(A)\\land\\tau^Q_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\exists xA)&\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\tau^Q_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^Q_r(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}[\\tau^Q_r(A)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau^Q_r:\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-realization]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["15c083801acd41a1","f748d191ce42f6ef"]}